# Sprint S<N> — {{PROJECT_NAME}}

> **The board.** This single file is the source of truth for the sprint: the
> active-state glance (header below), the task list with inline `[ ]/[x]/[~]/[B]`
> state, and the live per-task mini-retros (A009). Copy this template to
> `docs/project/sprints/S<N>/tasks.md` when you open a sprint.
>
> Replaces the old split of `STATUS.md` (glance) + `sprints/sprint-S<N>.md`
> (table) + `retros/sprint-S<N>-tasks.md` (mini-retros) — one board, no sync.

## Glance

| Field | Value |
|---|---|
| **Sprint** | S<N> — _(theme / goal in one line)_ |
| **Status** | 🟡 planned · 🚀 active · ✅ closed |
| **In-flight task** | _(task ID currently being worked, or —)_ |
| **Branch** | `main` (or the active feature branch) |
| **Last update** | YYYY-MM-DD |

## Tasks

> State legend: `[ ]` not started · `[~]` in progress / partial · `[x]` done ·
> `[B]` blocked. Update the row the moment state changes — never defer to close.
> Row format reference → `docs/designs/_templates/BACKLOG_ENTRY_TEMPLATE.md`.

| ID | Type | Title | Pri | Size | State | Design |
|----|------|-------|-----|------|-------|--------|
| {{TASK_ID_PREFIX}}-S<N>.01 | feat | **Example task** — what it does | P1 | M | `[ ]` | `designs/D001-slug.md` |
| {{TASK_ID_PREFIX}}-S<N>.02 | fix | **Example fix** — symptom | P2 | S | `[ ]` | — |

